OL,3,GNEWSABaby hat appeal reaches historic
OL,4,Amilestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which sends knitted baby
OL,7,Fitems to Ukraine has packed its
OL,8,F64,633rd donated item, the equivalent
OL,9,Fof one donation for every person living
OL,10,Fon Guernsey.
OL,12,FThe Newborn Baby Hats Appeal reached
OL,13,Fthe milestone on 3 October, marking
OL,14,Fwhat organisers described as a historic
OL,15,Fmoment for the volunteer-led project.
OL,17,FThe charity said data from Statistics
OL,18,FTimes showed there were 64,633 people
OL,19,Fon the island.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
